---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Start a project | Sudo Create" description="Tell Sudo Create about your app, website, or e-commerce project.">
  <header class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">Start a project</span><h1 class="display">What are you<br/>working on?</h1><p>A rough idea is enough to begin. Tell us what you’re making, what feels stuck, and what a good outcome would change.</p></div></header>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell content-grid"><div><h2 class="display">Pull up a chair.</h2><p>Prefer email? Write directly to <a style="text-decoration:underline" href="mailto:hello@sudocreate.studio">hello@sudocreate.studio</a>.</p><p class="fine-print muted">No sales maze. Your note goes straight to Shawn.</p></div><form class="contact-card" action="https://formsubmit.co/hello@sudocreate.studio" method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New Sudo Create project inquiry"/><input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false"/><div class="form-grid"><div><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required/></div><div><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required/></div><div><label for="kind">What are we making?</label><select id="kind" name="project_type"><option>Custom app</option><option>Website</option><option>E-commerce</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select></div><div><label for="budget">Working budget</label><select id="budget" name="budget"><option>Under $10k</option><option>$10k–$25k</option><option>$25k–$50k</option><option>$50k+</option><option>Let’s figure it out</option></select></div><div class="field-full"><label for="message">Tell us about it</label><textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="The idea, the problem, the deadline—whatever feels useful." required></textarea></div><div class="field-full"><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Send it over →</button></div></div></form></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
